================================================================================
EXCEPTION: Map Data Licensing
================================================================================

The published npm package (svg-world-maps) does NOT bundle any SVG map data.
Map data is distributed separately via the svg-world-maps-data repository:
https://github.com/homayounmmdy/svg-world-maps-data

However, this source repository contains SVG map files for development and
documentation purposes (for example in `docs/maps/`). Those
SVG map files are derived from SimpleMaps (https://simplemaps.com) and are
governed by the SimpleMaps SVG Map Library License
(https://simplemaps.com/resources/svg-license), NOT by the MIT license above.

You may use these map files for personal or commercial projects in accordance
with the SimpleMaps license. You may NOT redistribute the raw map data "as is"
or as a standalone product without prior written permission from SimpleMaps.
Attribution to SimpleMaps is appreciated as per their terms.

For the full map data license, see:
https://github.com/homayounmmdy/svg-world-maps-data/blob/main/LICENSE